id: flash-layout
section: Flash
item: A percentage size, three movies on a page, a movie in a frame, one scrolled in from below the fold and one shown after being hidden each draw at their bounds with input landing right
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&layout=percent
kit: cavekit-flash.md R4
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 4
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&layout=three
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 100 100
expect flash-at 100 100 3
flash-tap m3 400 300 showAll 300 200
expect flash-at 300 200 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&layout=frame
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&layout=below
wait text ready stage= 30
card-to 1400
wait settled 5
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&layout=hidden
wait rect show 20
tap show
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
